        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    wages = 25000\n    social_security_medicare_rate = 0.0765\n    employer_and_employee_shares = 2\n    futa_wage_base = 7000\n    futa_rate = 0.06\n    \n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    social_security_medicare_tax = (\n        wages * social_security_medicare_rate * employer_and_employee_shares\n    )\n    federal_unemployment_tax = min(wages, futa_wage_base) * futa_rate\n    total_tax = social_security_medicare_tax + federal_unemployment_tax\n    \n    # return answer\n    return round(total_tax)\n```",
